WEBVTT

00:10:58.030 --> 00:11:01.597
You need to take your traditional
segmentation plans

00:11:01.630 --> 00:11:03.863
one or two levels deeper.

00:11:04.363 --> 00:11:06.963
Yes, it's more work,

00:11:06.997 --> 00:11:09.263
but my continent is worth it.

00:11:09.297 --> 00:11:11.063
I want to leave you with this.

00:11:11.563 --> 00:11:14.763
A share of my wallet
is here for the taking.

00:11:15.097 --> 00:11:16.563
But not for long.

00:11:16.597 --> 00:11:19.030
African businesses are booming

00:11:19.063 --> 00:11:25.263
and trade across all 55 countries
is getting easier and faster by the day.

00:11:25.663 --> 00:11:31.830
So it won't be long before
non-African products are less desirable